<item>
            <title>[LU-20857] conf-sanity test_125: l_tunedisk failed to modify max_sectors_kb of ost1 in interop with 2.16.50+ servers</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20857</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;conf-sanity test_125 fails with &apos;test_125 failed with 2&apos; in interop testing when a client whose test scripts still contain test_125 (2.16.x, and b2_15) runs against servers at 2.16.50.172 or later.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the suite log, l_tunedisk leaves max_sectors_kb unchanged on the OST device:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Before: ost1 /dev/mapper/ost1_flakey 1279 2147483647
CMD: trevis-153vm34 l_tunedisk /dev/mapper/ost1_flakey
After: ost1 /dev/mapper/ost1_flakey 1279 2147483647
l_tunedisk failed to modify max_sectors_kb of ost1
 conf-sanity test_125: @@@@@@ FAIL: test_125 failed with 2
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12029&quot; title=&quot;do not try to muck with max_sectors_kb on multipath configurations&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-12029&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-12029&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/57278&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/57278&lt;/a&gt;, v2_16_50-172-g52dcb6d72e) removed max_sectors_kb tuning from l_tunedisk and deleted conf-sanity test_125 on master. The test still exists on b2_16 and b2_15, so it fails every time when those clients test against newer servers. The fix is a server version check in test_125 on the maintenance branches, skipping when OST1_VERSION &amp;gt;= 2.16.50.172 (or wherever &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12029&quot; title=&quot;do not try to muck with max_sectors_kb on multipath configurations&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-12029&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-12029&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; landed), or backporting the test removal.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Example: lustre-master-next full-part-3, servers 2.17.59_78_g0c93230, client 2.16.1:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/fad82d6c-0e43-4168-95c1-bd5053dba3c8&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/fad82d6c-0e43-4168-95c1-bd5053dba3c8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Seen in 78 enforced sessions over the recent window.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
