                            <comment id="502482" author="JIRAUSER24100" created="Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:38:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patrick-Bot: The bot filed this ticket for a Lustre CI failure and is working on it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="502483" author="JIRAUSER24100" created="Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:44:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Patrick-Bot: conf-sanity test_125 fails because b2_16/b2_15 test scripts still expect l_tunedisk to tune max_sectors_kb, which &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12029&quot; title=&quot;do not try to muck with max_sectors_kb on multipath configurations&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-12029&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-12029&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; removed from 2.16.50.172+ servers. Reproduced by running b2_16&apos;s test_125 against current master servers. The fix is a skip in b2_16/b2_15 conf-sanity when OST1_VERSION &amp;gt;= 2.16.50.172, which a maintenance-branch change must carry. Master needs no change.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;(run pw-failure-b7f2f80acc56)&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
